" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:LegKatrasWit.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/LegKatrasWit.png/420px-LegKatrasWit.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"527\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/LegKatrasWit.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Cauldron_of_Sora_Katra\" title=\"Cauldron of Sora Katra\">Cauldron of Sora Katra</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Legendary_Katra%27s_Razor_Wit\" title=\"Item:Legendary Katra&#39;s Razor Wit\">Legendary Katra's Razor Wit</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>A ring said to have been originally crafted for the hag queen Sora Katra. It makes its wearer glowingly charismatic, and allows him or her to sway others with words alone.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p>2 rings, identically or not, can be used for set bonus.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816224844\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.105 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.163 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4699/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34894/2097152 bytes\nTemplat